    <font size="2"> <i>January 24, 2002----In what is shaping up t be a
last ditch duel, pitting the oil and auto industries against environmental
groups, battle lines are being drawn as California seeks to become the
first state to regulate greenhouse gas emissions from cars.</i><br>
