about that.

I am fine coming home from Dallas at the same time as Steve on Wed 
morning.  If Mark would prefer me to stay and meet with the Aquila 
folks with him on Wed morning, I'm happy to do that too.  Whatever he 
prefers. 

We are having a great time.  Hong Kong is wonderful.  We are eating way 
too much.  We are off to the New Territories today.

