growth in the use of exchanges.

CREDIT
Susan Abbott of Moody's on evolving credit standards in our industry 

MARKETS
Kevin T. Howell of Dominion, Dave Freeman of Panda and Mike Young of Aquila on the state of various aspects of the power markets. 

AND MORE!
