From: Christopher Smith on 03/17/2000 09:57 AM
To: Yvan Chaxel/Corp/Enron@Enron, Benjamin Rogers/HOU/ECT@ECT
cc: William S Bradford/HOU/ECT@ECT, Randy Petersen/HOU/ECT@ECT, Donald M- ECT 
